      <h1>Server-Side SFTP Delivery</h1>
      <p class="dp-cover-desc">
        Moving CVIB bundle delivery off the Qt client's <code>sshpass</code> path and
        onto the server, where each recipient bank's SFTP credentials live
        AES-256-GCM encrypted and are decrypted only at the moment of transfer.
        The client hands the packaged bundle to Rails; the server pushes it, records
        an auditable delivery ledger, and sends the notification.
      </p>
      <div class="dp-cover-meta">
        <div>Version <b>1.1</b></div>
        <div>Updated <b>August 2026</b></div>
        <div>Status <b>Backend shipped · Qt in progress</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

